<title>UK: UK's OFT extends consideration of Energy bid.</title>
<headline>UK's OFT extends consideration of Energy bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Office of Fair Trading (OFT) on Tuesday extended the period for consideration of U.S.-based PacifiCorp'S bid for The Energy Group to August 5 from a previous deadline of July 15.</p>
<p>The OFT had asked for representations on the bid to be made by July 1.</p>
<p>PacifiCorp made its 3.7 billion stg recommended bid for The Energy Group, which includes Britain's biggest electricity distributor, Eastern Electricity, and generating assets in the UK, on June 13.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44171 542 7717</p>
</text>
